"title": "哈基",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "哈基",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>哈基</h1><p>迦得的兒子，也是哈基族的祖先（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen46:16\">創46:16</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Num26:15\">民26:15</a>）。</p>",
